flowchart TD
    A[Admin com chave interna] --> B[POST /knowledge/sources]
    B --> C[(knowledge_sources)]
    A --> D[POST /sources/{id}/ingest]
    D --> E[Chunk fixo: 2000 chars / 200 overlap]
    E --> F[EmbeddingsProvider local]
    F --> G[(knowledge_chunks + vector)]
    H[Mensagem do diagnóstico] --> I[Embedding da consulta]
    I --> J[similarity search + min_score]
    G --> J
    J --> K[Chunks no system prompt]
    K --> L[Resposta grounded + métricas]
